#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:10002
#: 8b35348bdb5640e2ab088c8a99e137f9
msgid "Fitting: Spectral Line Analysis"
msgstr "フィッティング: スペクトル線解析"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:10004
#: d49e093a387249ad9c8d76884b138f83
msgid ""
"This notebook demonstrates how to easily fit `TimeSeries` or "
"`FrequencySeries` data using the `gwexpy.fitting` module. The backend uses "
"`iminuit`, enabling least-squares fitting with error consideration."
msgstr ""
"[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-"
"badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/docs/web/en/user_guide/tutorials/advanced_fitting.ipynb)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:30002
#: feabf6f5d6ca4b8899b70b83767cd7bc
msgid "1. Data Preparation"
msgstr "1. データの準備"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:30004
#: efcbe7157f4a49f0a0e4690d222eae30
msgid "Here we create dummy data by adding noise to a Gaussian function."
msgstr "ここでは、ガウス関数にノイズを加えたダミーデータを作成します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:50002
#: 84fe1549a96444719a42f67f7525672e
msgid "2. Performing the Fit"
msgstr "2. フィッティングの実行"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:50004
#: 3b8cbfcd3d1449889b7ecd24dae894c2
msgid ""
"Use the `ts.fit()` method to perform fitting. Specify the model function and"
" initial parameter values `p0` as arguments."
msgstr "`ts.fit()` メソッドを使用してフィッティングを行います。 引数にはモデル関数と、パラメータの初期値 `p0` を指定します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:50007
#: 6431926a109342bc9b639ea025a457aa
msgid ""
"For narrow or localized peaks, constrain the center and width to physically "
"meaningful ranges so the optimizer does not wander into a noise-only local "
"minimum."
msgstr "狭いピークや局在したピークでは、中心周波数と幅に物理的に妥当な範囲を与え、ノイズだけの局所解へ流れないようにします。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:70002
#: 2f14fb2f8e4a44d9a70cb5b7b10328ac
msgid "3. Retrieving Results and Plotting"
msgstr "3. 結果の取得とプロット"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:70004
#: e5787790aab343299d2e36ba24ec33b4
msgid ""
"You can retrieve the best-fit parameters, errors, Chi2 values, etc. from the"
" `FitResult` object. Additionally, the `.plot()` method makes it easy to "
"visualize the results."
msgstr ""
"`FitResult` オブジェクトから、ベストフィットパラメータや誤差、Chi2 値などを取得できます。 また、`.plot()` "
"メソッドで簡単に結果を可視化できます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:90002
#: efea0cd121b149e2abfbe9a02c71d490
msgid "4. Specifying Models by String"
msgstr "3. 文字列によるモデル指定"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:90004
#: 1ea0e616796940e588f7292efcda4684
msgid ""
"Instead of defining a model function, you can specify a predefined model "
"name as a string. Currently supported models: `'gaus'`, `'exp'`, `'pol0'`, "
"`'pol1'`, ... `'pol9'`, `'landau'`, etc."
msgstr ""
"モデル関数を定義する代わりに、定義済みのモデル名を文字列で指定することもできます。 現在サポートされているモデル: `'gaus'`, `'exp'`,"
" `'pol0'`, `'pol1'`, ... `'pol9'`, `'landau'` など。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:90007
#: 3f3c953c53594877803aca6bcc30f6b0
msgid ""
"Below is an example using `'gaus'`. Restrict the fit window to the actual "
"visible peak so the predefined model is solving the same problem as the "
"callable example above."
msgstr ""
"以下は `'gaus'` を指定してフィッティングを行う例です。こちらも、目に見えているピーク帯域だけを切り出して callable "
"版と同じ問題設定に揃えます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:110002
#: 5cfe058b93554b7c9e177ea862784115
msgid "5. Complex Number Fitting (Transfer Functions)"
msgstr "4. 複素数フィッティング (伝達関数)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:110004
#: 5dc3dde5775a43a8846e4faecee27f6e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You can also fit complex data such as transfer functions. The cost function "
"$\\chi^2 = \\sum (Re_{diff})^2 + \\sum (Im_{diff})^2$ is minimized, fitting "
"real and imaginary parts simultaneously. The result plots automatically "
"become Bode plots (magnitude and phase)."
msgstr ""
"伝達関数などの複素数データに対してもフィッティングを行えます。 コスト関数として $\\chi^2 = \\sum (Re_{diff})^2 + "
"\\sum (Im_{diff})^2$ を最小化し、実部と虚部を同時にフィットします。 結果のプロットは自動的にボード線図（振幅・位相）になります。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:140002
#: b2e13b5dd2c6415c8c9a3bc0595b1356
msgid "6. MCMC Analysis (emcee)"
msgstr "5. MCMC 解析 (emcee)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:140004
#: 365a25c4945f48b194b93ed6dee5d4b9
msgid ""
"Using the maximum likelihood estimate obtained from `iminuit` as the initial"
" value, you can perform MCMC (Markov Chain Monte Carlo) analysis using "
"`emcee`."
msgstr ""
"`iminuit` で得られた最尤推定値を初期値として、`emcee` を用いた MCMC (Markov Chain Monte Carlo) "
"解析を行うことができます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:140006
#: 01cdca7443634876849d63c915f5f7d2
msgid "**Note:** To use this feature, `emcee` and `corner` must be installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:160002
#: edad8d07694e46ef91178ba74da9110c
msgid "Example Usage of New Common Models"
msgstr "新しい共通モデルの使用例"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:160004
#: 1ac064a42155436da30878dc9b168a64
msgid ""
"These are usage examples of `power_law` and `damped_oscillation` added to "
"`gwexpy.fitting.models`."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy.fitting.models` に追加された `power_law` と `damped_oscillation` の使用例です。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:180002
#: 40e5b74b556747278b273b869262216f
msgid "7. Spectral Line Fitting: Lorentzian and Voigt Profiles"
msgstr "7. スペクトル線フィッティング：ローレンツ関数と Voigt プロファイル"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:180004
#: 7d7e59640fda46c4b0d72d56da76eecb
msgid ""
"In gravitational-wave detector commissioning, narrowband resonances "
"(mechanical modes, violin modes, line injections) appear as sharp peaks in "
"ASD spectra.   Three profiles are commonly used:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: 4478d8209c734bb786426d96dd5f93b0
msgid "Model"
msgstr "モデル"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: d4858ba7ca0344a0a11d8ffea94f062b
msgid "When to use"
msgstr "使いどき"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: 6ba675faec944fed84dabf465eb2271a
msgid "**Gaussian**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: 66670e31938c4e02ace15a0c5638069e
msgid "Doppler- or pressure-broadened lines; truly symmetric noise peaks"
msgstr "ドップラー・圧力広がり；対称なノイズピーク"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: 3bedf6af183d4dda9f7e4aa0bedfee55
msgid "**Lorentzian**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: 4b722fec209249c58f78ca2f43826ca3
msgid "Resonances with a single loss mechanism (Q-limited linewidth)"
msgstr "単一損失機構による共振（Q 値で幅が決まる）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: e3685ea0da7e4b65beeaa7a8f1c2f60d
msgid "**Voigt**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb
#: 0ccb2a2f51264baabcfd6a9c0be90e68
msgid ""
"Composite broadening (Gaussian instrument resolution + Lorentzian damping)"
msgstr "ガウス（計器分解能）＋ローレンツ（減衰）の複合広がり"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:180014
#: e52eff8f54c74040a65103d2ec1aaa2e
msgid ""
"All three are available in `gwexpy.fitting.models` and can be referenced by "
"string."
msgstr "いずれも `gwexpy.fitting.models` に実装済みで、文字列名での指定が可能です。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:190002
#: b049fbccc25641e4b7a4cb160f5d3327
msgid "7a. Lorentzian (HWHM parameterisation)"
msgstr "7a. ローレンツ関数（HWHM パラメータ化）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:190004
#: 757cdb5265834c3294430bcc2784a6d0
#, python-brace-format
msgid "f(x) = \\frac{A\\,\\gamma^2}{(x - x_0)^2 + \\gamma^2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:190006
#: d58a05fb9056478b8c297e8c0d9a836a
msgid "`A` : peak amplitude"
msgstr "`A` : ピーク振幅"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:190007
#: d3149b36194e4c9998c35b95260e10bc
msgid "`x0`: centre frequency"
msgstr "`x0`: 中心周波数"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:190008
#: 5ee33357a54649de9115042e9687602a
msgid "`gamma`: half-width at half-maximum (HWHM)"
msgstr "`gamma`: 半値半幅 (HWHM)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:210002
#: ea66605d7a2441aab8cd1aa6eab22a2e
msgid "7b. Lorentzian Q-factor parameterisation"
msgstr "7b. ローレンツ Q 値パラメータ化"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:210004
#: 51f6246282d44f68891f6ac72679c2d3
msgid ""
"For resonators it is often more natural to express the linewidth via the "
"quality factor $Q = x_0 / (2\\gamma)$:"
msgstr "共振器では線幅を品質係数 $Q = x_0 / (2\\gamma)$ で表すと直感的です："

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:210007
#: b7b254e6ab9e44d9ac58053f472c1e44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"f(x) = \\frac{A\\,\\gamma^2}{(x - x_0)^2 + \\gamma^2}, \\quad \\gamma = "
"\\frac{x_0}{2Q}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:210009
#: 1073968d44654ffda413e507876d2ae9
msgid "Use `'lorentzian_q'` to fit directly in terms of `(A, x0, Q)`."
msgstr "`'lorentzian_q'` を使うと `(A, x0, Q)` を直接フィットできます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:230002
#: b29602fca9c24d97b8f47270c3f753b2
msgid "7c. Voigt Profile"
msgstr "7c. Voigt プロファイル"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:230004
#: e34f82bae27b4717a2df48fbc6fb2c2d
msgid ""
"The Voigt profile is the convolution of a Gaussian (width $\\sigma$) and a "
"Lorentzian (HWHM $\\gamma$).  It is computed via the **Faddeeva function** "
"for efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_fitting.ipynb:230007
#: 7d323dd4847c42e58128470e4c43d8bd
msgid ""
"Use it when the line shows both instrument-resolution broadening (Gaussian) "
"and intrinsic damping (Lorentzian)."
msgstr ""
